%% title: Failure: the host applier crashes mid-switch and resumes
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as host applier
    participant K as API server
    participant A2 as host applier, restarted
    A->>K: take the Lease, cordon, evict
    A->>A: crashes before switching
    A2->>K: Lease still mine? node cordoned?
    A2->>A2: resume: switch, health check
    A2->>K: uncordon, release the Lease
